en:
"Welcome to the fairy village, after your long journey.
I am Meem, the Fairy King."{w}{p}"This is the hidden village of the fairies.
What business have you here, people of the land?"{w}{p}"Whether you came by design or by chance, I know not.{w}But mind your conduct.{w}The folk of this village do not think kindly of the people of the land."{w}

"The land you live on is maintained by our brethren.
Were you aware of that fact?"{w}{p}"Though we live hidden away in the fairy village,
even we cannot be indifferent to the affairs of the land.{w}We, too, love the land."{w}{p}"I do not mean to lay a debt upon you.{w}It is only that you must never forget it.{w}I would have you engrave it upon your hearts."{w}

"To maintain the land itself...{w}I, Meem, the Fairy King, have never forgotten
their devotion, not for a single moment."{w}{p}"The land is the world itself.{w}Without the world, no one can live."{w}{p}"That is no less true for us.
Whatever the past may have been, that fact does not change."{w}

{0E}"Ugh, honestly! You're all exaggerating!
If someone's in trouble, I help them.{0F}
That's only natural, right?"{w}

{0E}"One way or another, you guys sure know a lot...
I really do need to study.{0F}
And I have to work harder at alchemy, too..."{w}

{0E}"Ninja! Ninja's the way to go!
YAMURU IS DECAPITATED!{0F}
*ding* R.I.P.!"{w}

"You can just go end up
    *INSIDE THE STONE*
all by yourself!"{w}

{0E}"Those two make an Angel's Window...
I know that one, since I've made it before.{0F}
And then Ma... Mazu... Mazu-ree-tay?"{w}

{0E}"Yamuru!{0F}
...It's all right, okay?"{w}{p}"If I wanted to change classes, I wouldn't be studying alchemy.{w}I'm studying like this because
I decided to keep at it, see?"{w}

"Ah! Don't you run away, you bastard!
I didn't get to lop off a single head!
HEEEADS!!"{w}
